          <Dialog>By the way...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Takane</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Um, what？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What were you like as a
kid,
▲高嶺＊＊▲？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>As a kid？ Hmm, lessons,
lessons, lessons.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh... What kind？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Swimming, calligraphy,
piano, ballet, tennis,
and... Oh, cram school too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Sounds busy... Did your
parents make you？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No. If anything, it was my
idea.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whenever I heard so-and-so
started something, I'd say
"Me too."</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I tried so hard. It's funny,
thinking about it now.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(She hated losing... That
makes sense.)</Dialog>
