          <Dialog>By the way...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Takane</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Um, what？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Do you get along with your
family,
▲高嶺＊＊▲？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>We do？ On days off, the
three of us go shopping and
things.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>The other day, Mama and I
were walking together and
someone thought we were
sisters.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh, your mom must have been
thrilled.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes, it was good up to 
that part, but...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Mama said "Maybe I've still
got it," and Papa sulked.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It was a whole thing. He
cheered up in the end, so
that's good.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>The Takanes are so
lovey-dovey.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes, incredibly. I'd like to
be like that someday...
Hehe.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Yeah, I'm jealous.)</Dialog>
